<title>AUSTRIA: Opel Austria reports record revenues for 96.</title>
<headline>Opel Austria reports record revenues for 96.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Opel Austria GmbH, a unit of General Motors Europe, reported on Thursday record revenues of 19.8 billion schillings for 1996 and a 40 percent surge in net income to 2.1 billion schillings.</p>
<p>Revenues rose four percent from 1995 while pre-tax profit remained steady at 2.1 billion schillings, Opel said in a statement.</p>
<p>Opel Austria exports all of its products. Export earnings rose to 13.8 billion schillings from 13 billion in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Vienna newsroom, +431 531 12 256</p>
</text>
